    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Add this panel to your project and as many KeyBinding Button prefabs as
    your project needs.  Each key you want to make configurable will need a KeyBinding
    Button prefab.  The prefab can be found in the Prefabs folder of this sample
    project.  \n\nAfter adding a KeyBinding prefab, add an action in the On Click
    section of the Button component in the inspector.  Make the button call the SetKeyBindingIndex
    method from the Input Controller script, and fill in the integer index for this
    particular action.  Each button will need a unique index.  See the examples above."
